📝 *Contributing to OWASP Nest*

*Getting started*
• Read the *Contributor Guide*: https://github.com/OWASP/Nest/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md
• Explore the codebase: https://github.com/OWASP/Nest
• Browse open issues to find work to contribute: https://github.com/OWASP/Nest/issues

*Ways to contribute*
• Contribute code, documentation, tests, or design feedback
• Help review issues, reproduce bugs, or improve project documentation
• Share knowledge by writing tutorials or giving talks

💬 *Connect with the community*
• Join #project-nest for project discussion and weekly huddles
• Join #gsoc for Google Summer of Code questions and support

Start with the Contributor Guide, then ask in #project-nest or #contribute if you need help choosing an issue or setting up your local environment.
